# SUB-12.1 P1 #4: data/frozen/ (golden_network.inp, golden_scenario.json)
# is the one data/ subtree the runtime image needs -- the LIVE example's
# real reference inputs (GET /api/live-example-inputs) are computed from
# it. Everything else under data/ (training corpora, generated caches)
# stays out of the build context.
data/*
!data/frozen
!data/frozen/**
# Submission-readiness SUB-1 (P0): the frozen V4 release bundle is the one
# models/ subtree the runtime image actually needs (Dockerfile COPYs it in
# and serves it via HYDROSWARM_V4_BUNDLE_DIR) -- everything else under
# models/ (training checkpoints, cycle-b2 candidates/controls) stays out of
# the build context, both to keep it small and so the image never bundles
# unpromoted/non-frozen weights.
models/*
!models/hydrocore-v4-release
!models/hydrocore-v4-release/**
experiments
reports
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
